{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "63dbb6c468b2cfbf41334f023033fd83a73227acb12cf9a3671052d18c951c7d", "ja": "（天体公演とSTARDOM ROAD、大きな話題となった\n二本柱。その集大成となる感謝祭の準備が進んでいる）", "zh": "（天体公演和STARDOM ROAD，这两大主题引发了广泛关注。作为两者集大成的感谢祭，准备工作正在推进中。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1001_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1002_p", "source_sha256": "360528432c4506a88247c6e5815d5d2f305a3950c4e3ddb840a3bdbda2e24557", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n新しい楽曲発注書、お渡ししておきますね。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n这是新的歌曲委托单，先交给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "46a2c91eb95c71cff586b37170fdb9fdb5011cdb5d960c0793fd52f8cea68f0e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\nわかりました。目を通しておきます！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。明白了，我先看一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "6136de67ef0e1d0c24777963f94d9f16db53dfeb07382fe5d016a5f09cfa2fbd", "ja": "あ、それと！　衣装の確認をしておきましたよ。\nやっぱり綻びや、へたってる部分が目立ちますね……。", "zh": "啊，对了！我已经确认过服装了。\n果然有些开线和磨损的地方很明显呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4c46b9a61b6636eabd2aec11d77604f28008da930b99ff4830b98840eab80933", "ja": "ああ……ダンスだけじゃなくステージアクションが\n激しい回もありましたからね……。", "zh": "啊……不只是舞蹈，有些场次的舞台动作也很激烈呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "61a1ff7d68295f7a34b6a6196bb8a616463f6f5fa2b7de695f1b23a6ce181612", "ja": "……。\nあ。もしかして、もう作業してしまいましたか？", "zh": "……\n啊。难不成，你已经开始动手修了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "299105cec846986b66d504583b9c273606c1abd78efb85c8ee35b2f8b2dc8931", "ja": "あ、いいえ！　まだ手を付けてなくて……と言うか、\n私、修繕はしない方がいいかもって思うんです。", "zh": "啊，不是！我还没开始处理……其实，\n我觉得还是不要修比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "a0c2d53796488398c61113cef6a6f650ef628f7c6f5176f57fbdf7d680e32e25", "ja": "だって、長い道のりを走り抜けた記念の、\n感謝祭で展示する衣装なんですから！", "zh": "因为这是为了纪念大家一路走来的漫长旅程，要在感谢祭上展示的服装啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "cfa1f0100d45e42ab0170c9130fba9fbe2695e130229c2380c342b7cf57a4af9", "ja": "アイドルのみんなが、どれほど頑張ってきたか、\nお客さん達に少しでも伝わってほしいなって……。", "zh": "我希望客人们多少能感受到，偶像们一路以来究竟有多么努力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1011_102mis", "source_sha256": "684090a8492e4136a1e8f8094685ad3ff78326629918121fdb048b1037dfd8c9", "ja": "そう考えたら、やっぱりそのままがいいです。\n綻びもへたりも、みんなの勲章ですから！", "zh": "这么一想，果然还是保持原样比较好。\n无论是磨损还是疲惫，都是大家的勋章！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1012_p", "source_sha256": "c44d34fdeccc0c4e3e43cd8b7ee4fe4681a87ffb36d6764eabde45dd342037e9", "ja": "……その判断、助かります。\nぜひそのままでいきましょう！", "zh": "……你能这么决定真是帮大忙了。\n就这么办吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "257c6ea7e3fb7c9466b14660b333e95430ae1c1a8c33a94ee2bc402a154454c4", "ja": "えへへ♪　……あ、それと、社長さんがお呼びでした\nよ！　感謝祭公演の企画内容を確認したいって。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪……啊，对了，社长找您哦！说是想确认一下感恩祭公演的企划内容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "25bc87c80f8a3a6be542551a8a8b0ecc739894e54296e9b9df45c269f81508a6", "ja": "わかりました！\nそれでは、このまま事務所に向かいますね！", "zh": "明白了！\n那我就直接回事务所了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "f6b154ab9645579f41e64917e66b215276743d8d2e99650d6e6211174ac85b0f", "ja": "はい！　いってらっしゃ～い！\n……今回の衣装も、気合いを入れなくちゃ！", "zh": "好的！路上小心～！\n……这次的服装也得好好加把劲才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1016_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1017_president", "source_sha256": "515305ee3bd815f6b84530471f1d0c2dcc5e83fb1a16e4f2c533b31a35a9a33c", "ja": "『ソル』『ルナ』『ステラ』の天体公演、\nそして『STARDOM ROAD』……。", "zh": "“Sol”“Luna”“Stella”的天体公演，\n以及“STARDOM ROAD”……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "77cb628ed7d59ea34619b1e0a218382bd46feb8ffaad3d64be57391d9c0a9ce3", "ja": "並走して行われたふたつの長期公演、\n君は見事にやり遂げてくれたね。ご苦労だった！", "zh": "同时进行的两场长期公演，你出色地完成了它们。辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1019_p", "source_sha256": "b876f3737f5aafd48af9436be668b365aee3b9d81bc8f31c020a80f1ef23c2e0", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　なによりも、\nアイドルみんなが頑張ってくれたお陰ですよ。", "zh": "谢谢！最重要的是，多亏了偶像们的努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1020_p", "source_sha256": "87d426965879024528a7842d0e336f789c988b18786894078c043ece5cfca830", "ja": "それと……長きに渡って絶え間なく\n支え続けてくれたファンのみなさんも、です。", "zh": "还有……长久以来始终不间断地支持着我们的各位粉丝，也是如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1021_101kot", "source_sha256": "2e138617e6c9fef8d4fa2854cd6384f9d48daeee0e45cc42e6b76f9e6c159eaa", "ja": "本当にそうですね。追いかけるために、たくさんの\n時間や労力を費やしてくれてるはずですものね。", "zh": "确实如此。为了追随偶像，大家一定也花费了许多时间和精力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "485be140184796c5027be5b65ede2c965a0e8da3e52f876e868832cca7cdf45b", "ja": "決して無理はしてほしくありませんけど……\nいわゆる推し活というものは、嬉しいものですよね！", "zh": "我可绝对不希望你们勉强自己……不过，所谓的追星活动，确实会让人感到开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "2162fdb430cbca3699e46e033a38e0fff5c4b3de8a1ba97d3a92408b435a1ed8", "ja": "その通りだ。そこで、今回はふたつの公演を\n支え続けてくれたファン達のためにも……！", "zh": "没错。所以，这次也是为了那些一直支持两场演出的粉丝们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "f7ee8f023ce32059b703eaedea993177e02a3e4064731ba1d2c9d7129c547664", "ja": "盛大に！　豪勢に！　華やかに！\n感謝祭公演を開催しようというわけだ！", "zh": "盛大地！豪华地！华丽地！\n也就是说，要举办感谢祭公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "50c992948a2270b91c04c9089e047e14f7a26cbe127431611ce369c2fc24f597", "ja": "はい！　アイドル達からの感謝をコンセプトに、\n手作り感を重視した装飾を考えてます。", "zh": "好的！以偶像们的感谢为主题，我们正在构思注重手工感的装饰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "be96c17c7f60accd233d2f49825ecef4c8d8e0e3f322c431e8b72c2b0761bf80", "ja": "実際に用いた台本や衣装、小道具などの展示、\n大道具を背景にしたフォトスポット……。", "zh": "比如实际使用过的剧本、服装和小道具等展品，\n还有以大型布景为背景的拍照打卡点……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f234c98ef00f628d0c9f9c4a3bf14534a4ad23bb968a6518e0307f6653f5fe4b", "ja": "ミニ朗読劇や、裏側が覗けるトークショーなど、\nたくさんの催しも予定しているところですよ。", "zh": "迷你朗读剧、可以一窥幕后情况的脱口秀等许多活动，也都在筹备中哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "73ae62372291cbe60db897207f8e17071ddf03310816e0906c49b924ccba7645", "ja": "楽しそうですね！　花形となるライブステージは、\n代表として5人が出場、でしたよね？", "zh": "听起来很有意思！作为重头戏的现场舞台，是由5人代表出场，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "7271b70a6dd75b3b6458c72712332fcf2411f5ae0275e67a6d1a2d44a2fd141c", "ja": "うむ。馬場このみ君、天海春香君、松田亜利沙君、\n田中琴葉君、中谷育君……。", "zh": "嗯。马场木实、天海春香、松田亚利沙、\n田中琴叶、中谷育……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1030_president", "source_sha256": "69bf49cdf4ae3cc2e49a7886f0bb54f4d2be5745b7d64d345ca75046bf8ee6e6", "ja": "この5名による新曲ステージが大トリとなる！\n君の裁量で、どんどん進めてくれたまえ。", "zh": "由这5名成员带来的新曲舞台将压轴登场！  \n请凭你的判断，尽管推进吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1031_p", "source_sha256": "cc0113d7c35ecfebd9abd354e25cf1019810a318ed91e3673862539766904381", "ja": "はい！　ふたつの星を、ふたつの公演を\n最後まで応援し続けてくれた人たちに……。", "zh": "是！献给那些一直支持着两颗星、两场公演直到最后的人们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1032_p", "source_sha256": "4cf90640f723f6247da904bfb1311c62b7e73ecc115752bf343d5474dd0e4c07", "ja": "アイドルと一緒に、最大級の感謝を届けます！", "zh": "和偶像一起，向大家献上最诚挚的感谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0373_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0373_story_intro_1033_president", "source_sha256": "10ceb5143eb807874fd40316cc6cceefc711644c743dd1b9700dc2dc55f016f1", "ja": "うむ、素晴らしい意気込みだ！\n今回もよろしく頼むよ～！", "zh": "嗯，干劲十足，很棒！\n这次也拜托你啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
